Use the [selection policy](../../methods/creative-technology/selection-policy.md)
and [matrix](../../methods/creative-technology/selection-matrix.md). Open at
DX-02; prepare before prototype implementation; complete prototype/device
results and final decision at DX-04 before production build. Record approvals
in [decisions.md](decisions.md); silence is not approval.

