## Mobile, performance and accessibility strategy

D-0023 is binding: mobile p75 LCP ≤ 2.0 s, INP ≤ 200 ms, CLS ≤ 0.1,
≤ 2 MB transferred before first interaction, 60 fps target on a mid-range
phone and a complete reduced-motion path. Stricter project budgets are allowed;
a looser budget needs a founder-approved exception in decisions.md.

